'''Ancient Egg: N112''' is a [[:Category:Rare Cats|Rare Cat]] that can be unlocked from the [[Catnip Challenges]] after completing 60 [[Behemoth Culling]] stages for the first time. It was added in [[Version 12.7 Update|Version 12.7]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 724
|rarity = RR
|name1 = Ancient Egg: N112
|name2 = Mystic Egg: N112
|name3 = Cat Egg Pod
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Mystic Egg: N112''' at level 10.

Evolves into '''Cat Egg Pod''' at level 30 using [[Catfruit#Behemoth Stones|Behemoth Stones]] and XP.

==Strategy/Usage==
==='''Normal/Evolved Form'''===
These forms are <u>useless by design</u>. Similarly to the other [[:Category:Ancient Eggs|Ancient Eggs]], this unit is not meant to be used before its True Form. However, due to its somewhat low cost and quick recharge, it may be used as an emergency meatshield in [[Underground Labyrinth]] or [[Legend Quest]] if you have no use for its True Form.

==='''True Form'''===
This unit can be considered the anti-[[:Category:Behemoth Enemies|Behemoth]] equivalent of [[Curling Cat (Rare Cat)|Green Shell Cat]], with its high health, incredible [[Dodge Attack|Dodge]] ability, singular knockback, long cooldown, astronomically long backswing, and high attack power as well (44,280 base attack at level 50, close to Bullet Train Cat, made 110,700 damage against Behemoths). Though its base health is less than that of Green Shell Cat (equal to Cleanerbot Cat), it's still a serviceable tanker that can hold the line for a reasonable amount of time even against non-Behemoths if your other defensive units just couldn't cut it. It lacks certain immunities that may leave it vulnerable to some Behemoths like [[Casaurian Darkjo]] and its Toxic, but it does see great matchups against many other Behemoths. Even when up against the likes of stat-based threats like [[Wild Doge]], the unit still offers a ridiculous deal of defense that shatters the difficulty of Behemoth stages, and remains valuable despite its very steep True Form requirement.

{{Job|Classification = User Rank Dump & Meatshield|TrueClass = Tanker & Rusher|UltraClass=}}

