==Trivia==
*Cat Egg Pod's Japanese name, Neko Tamagō (ネコタマ号, "Cat Tama-Unit"), is a pun on 卵 ''tamago'' (an egg; a beginner or rookie) and 号 ''gō'' (suffix used after a vehicle's name).
*Cat Egg Pod has the longest backswing and attack frequency in the game.
*Cat Egg Pod is the only [[:Category:Behemoth Slayer Cats|Behemoth Slayer]] whose dodge does not last 1 second.

